# 🧰 Tools & Commands Cheat Sheet

A beginner-friendly reference of commands I use in CTFs. Each block explains **what the command does** so I understand it rather than just copy it.

> ⚖️ **Ethics reminder:** Only run these commands against files and systems that the CTF organizers provided and authorized. Never use them on systems you don't own or have permission to test.

**Contents:** [Linux](#-linux-basics) · [Web](#-web-exploitation) · [Cryptography](#-cryptography) · [Forensics](#-forensics) · [Steganography](#-steganography) · [OSINT](#-osint)

